   "dur": 1.7,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 8.23,
   "e": 14.3,
   "dur": 6.07,
   "text": "That intro got me really excited about this recipe and I realized it's in their bio. When I go to the bio, there's a separate link."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 14.3,
   "e": 17.83,
   "dur": 3.53,
   "text": "And when I click on that link, it took me to a whole gallery of recipes that I have"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 17.83,
   "e": 21.03,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "text": "to scroll down so far to find the cookie one. I click on the cookie"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 21.03,
   "e": 26.27,
   "dur": 5.23,
   "text": "one, I watch some ads and read through the author's entire life story to get to the ingredients."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 26.27,
   "e": 32.43,
   "dur": 6.17,
   "text": "I hate when people do stuff like that, so make it easier for all of you. I listen to the ingredients on my Instagram, link in bio."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 32.43,
   "e": 34.0,
   "dur": 1.57,
   "text": "The number one secret"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 34.0,
   "e": 42.9,
   "dur": 8.9,
   "text": "to a perfect chocolate chip cookie is to brown your butter. Our first step is to brown a whole block of butter. You want to keep stirring it and be careful because it might explode like this."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 42.9,
   "e": 43.77,
   "dur": 0.87,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 43.77,
   "e": 49.27,
   "dur": 5.5,
   "text": "You'll lose some of the water during the browning process, so we recommend adding a few tablespoons back"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 49.27,
   "e": 54.4,
   "dur": 5.13,
   "text": "in. We'll stir in some ice cubes just to add back the moisture. We recommend using a mixture of bread and"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 54.4,
   "e": 55.3,
   "dur": 0.9,
   "text": "all-purpose flour."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 55.3,
   "e": 62.0,
   "dur": 6.7,
   "text": "I'm using all AP flour. It's called all-purpose for a reason. A cup in three quarters along with one teaspoon of salt and baking soda."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 62.0,
   "e": 70.1,
   "dur": 8.1,
   "text": "A teaspoon of espresso powder to enhance the chocolate flavor. A couple of brown sugar, half a couple white sugar, and a teaspoon of vami espresso."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 70.1,
   "e": 75.2,
   "dur": 5.1,
   "text": "And the best cookie dough consistency uses 1 egg yolk mixed with 1 regular egg."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 75.2,
   "e": 92.13,
   "dur": 16.93,
   "text": "Dessert MSG, 1 egg, 1 egg yolk, butter from earlier, and mix everything till smooth. Combining the dry ingredients was the wet mixture. Combine the wet mixture with the dry ingredients. Bigger piece left chopped chocolate in addition to smaller chips, to create the perfect wealth of gooey goodness."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 92.13,
   "e": 108.57,
   "dur": 16.43,
   "text": "We're throwing some chocolate chips and snap some chocolate bars. We'll fold it in, shape it, ideally you want to freeze it for a night but it's not ideal right now so 350 for 14 minutes."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 108.57,
   "e": 120.09,
   "dur": 11.53,
   "text": "The brown butter definitely deepens the flavor a lot but it's a chocolate chip cookie and the margins of improvement is pretty small. Anything with an obscene amount of butter and sugar is above a knife so this one is a 9.5. Alright thank"
  }
 ],
